      "@type": "Claim",
      "label": "A complete public provider/stake/challenge/reputation path was not located in this inspection",
      "description": "Configured runtime providers, leases/meters, job-cell accounting, bounded service custody, and relay fault adjudication exist in separate paths. No devnet shadow-penalty leaderboard or funded public provider registry was located.",
